{"4229460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Night", "steam_appid": 4229460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The catastrophe began in the &quot;Quantum Alien&quot; laboratory, but it ended with the death of all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A deadly virus destroyed civilization in a matter of days. But you survived. A random genetic mutation made you immune to the infection. Now your blood is both a blessing and a curse. In a world that has been forever changed, your only goal is to survive at any cost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Q — crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) I — inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) B — building (But first you need to craft a construction scheme in the craft panel)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Left Shift — self-explosion (If there is a grenade in the inventory)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) WASD | Arrows — movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6) LMB | RMB — shooting, throwing a projectile</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/b9d7c7c6e1c90508ae38136e3f559b6c.poster.avif?t=1772413413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/b9d7c7c6e1c90508ae38136e3f559b6c.webm?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/b9d7c7c6e1c90508ae38136e3f559b6c.mp4?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of the old world. Every resource you find, from stone to gold, can save your life. Mine, craft, and adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/e1770bf0b40ded6a6ae0cc72f7ce8cf5.poster.avif?t=1772413413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/e1770bf0b40ded6a6ae0cc72f7ce8cf5.webm?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/e1770bf0b40ded6a6ae0cc72f7ce8cf5.mp4?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night spares no one. Build an impregnable fortress, set traps, and install automatic turrets. When the Mega Horde arrives, only your walls will separate you from certain death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/75991df9bcba04bb0dc2ed511f98899f.poster.avif?t=1772413413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/75991df9bcba04bb0dc2ed511f98899f.webm?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/75991df9bcba04bb0dc2ed511f98899f.mp4?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no laws here anymore. A huge arsenal of weapons is your only argument in a dispute with mutants. Kill or become a feed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Features of the game and interesting mechanics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1) Support for multiplayer (up to 8 players). Survive with your friends.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2) Resource extraction and enemy attack are performed by</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The catastrophe began in the &quot;Quantum Alien&quot; laboratory, but it ended with the death of all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A deadly virus destroyed civilization in a matter of days. But you survived. A random genetic mutation made you immune to the infection. Now your blood is both a blessing and a curse. In a world that has been forever changed, your only goal is to survive at any cost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Q — crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) I — inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) B — building (But first you need to craft a construction scheme in the craft panel)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Left Shift — self-explosion (If there is a grenade in the inventory)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) WASD | Arrows — movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6) LMB | RMB — shooting, throwing a projectile</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/b9d7c7c6e1c90508ae38136e3f559b6c.poster.avif?t=1772413413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/b9d7c7c6e1c90508ae38136e3f559b6c.webm?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/b9d7c7c6e1c90508ae38136e3f559b6c.mp4?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of the old world. Every resource you find, from stone to gold, can save your life. Mine, craft, and adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/e1770bf0b40ded6a6ae0cc72f7ce8cf5.poster.avif?t=1772413413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/e1770bf0b40ded6a6ae0cc72f7ce8cf5.webm?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/e1770bf0b40ded6a6ae0cc72f7ce8cf5.mp4?t=1772413413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night spares no one. Build an impregnable fortress, set traps, and install automatic turrets. When the Mega Horde arrives, only your walls will separate you from certain death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229460/extras/75991df9bcba04bb0dc2ed511f98899f.poster.avif?t=1772413413\"